# Mike Fitness Tracker - local development env (EXAMPLE - safe to commit).
#
# Copy this file to ".env.local" and fill in your real values.
#
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# ".env.local" itself is git-ignored and must NEVER be committed:
# it will contain your real Supabase project URL and anon key.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL       - your real Supabase project URL
#                           (https://xxxx.supabase.co). Do not commit it.
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  - the PUBLIC anon key only. Never the service_role
#                           key. Do not commit the real value.
# VITE_APP_NAME           - display name shown in the app.
# VITE_APP_ENV            - "development" locally, "production" on Vercel.
#
# Leave the Supabase values blank to run in LOCAL MODE (localStorage only).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_APP_NAME=Mike Fitness Tracker
VITE_APP_ENV=development
